===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|computing}} A device used for storing large amounts of [[data]] for a [[computer]] that persist while the computer is turned off.

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|hard disc}}, {{l|en|hard disk}}
* {{l|en|hard disc drive}}, {{l|en|hard disk drive}}
* {{l|en|HD}}, {{l|en|HDD}} {{qualifier|abbreviation}}

